    },
    "本机学习数据已关联其他账号，已阻止上传、拉取和 AI 发送。请登录首次关联的账号。本机练习仍可使用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This device's learning data is linked to another account. Upload, download and AI requests are blocked. Sign in with the original account. Local practice remains available."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机学习数据已关联其他账号，已阻止上传、拉取和 AI 发送。请登录首次关联的账号。本机练习仍可使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机仍共用一份学习数据，切换账号不会隐藏或搬移记录。首次登录会关联这份数据，之后仅该账号可同步或发送 AI 总结；退出或删号不会解除关联。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This device shares one learning dataset. Changing accounts does not hide or move it. The first sign-in links the data; only that account can sync or request AI summaries. Signing out or deleting the account does not remove the link."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机仍共用一份学习数据，切换账号不会隐藏或搬移记录。首次登录会关联这份数据，之后仅该账号可同步或发送 AI 总结；退出或删号不会解除关联。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重置和清空只影响本机，不会删除云端记录；再次同步可能恢复云端已有的经验、进度或错题。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resetting or clearing affects only this device. Cloud records remain and may return on the next sync."
