    "无法访问安全登录存储，请解锁设备后重试。现有登录信息未被覆盖。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unable to access secure sign-in storage. Unlock your device and try again. Your existing sign-in information has not been overwritten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "或使用 Apple 账号": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Or use your Apple Account"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "或使用 Apple 账号"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple 登录创建独立账号，不会自动合并已有账号或会员。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple sign-in creates a separate account. Existing accounts and memberships are not merged automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 登录创建独立账号，不会自动合并已有账号或会员。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple 登录未配置或暂时不可用，请稍后重试。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign in with Apple is not configured or is temporarily unavailable. Please try again later."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 登录未配置或暂时不可用，请稍后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple 登录验证已失效，请重新使用 Apple 登录。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple sign-in verification has expired or is invalid. Please sign in with Apple again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 登录验证已失效，请重新使用 Apple 登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此邮箱已用于其他星芽账号，请使用原来的登录方式。Apple 账号不会自动合并。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This email is already used by another Xingya account. Use your original sign-in method. Apple accounts are not merged automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此邮箱已用于其他星芽账号，请使用原来的登录方式。Apple 账号不会自动合并。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此账号不可用或正在删除，请稍后重试。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This account is unavailable or is being deleted. Please try again later."
